            "review_text": "Kyle N\nZurich, Switzerland12 contributions\n0\nA sense of Freshness\nSep 2015 • Friends\nIt was absolutely the best Japanese cuisine in town that friend of mine and I have experienced so far. Authentic, freshness and sophistication that I believe exactly the words to describe the foods. This restaurant offers you a bunch of options which combine the tradition and modern techniques. Other than that, the staff were very welcome and attentive to fulfil customer expectations. Of course, the price is parallel with the quality so do not let it borders your awareness. Believe me, the cusine itself reflects the values of justification. Highly recommended to everyone who loves enjoying the terrific sushi in Ho Chi Minh city.\nRead more\nWritten September 19, 2015",
